{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地花旦趙露思的新劇《告別信》近日已正式開機，連日來有不少拍攝路透，昨日（15日）趙露思被拍到在街頭爆喊，相當慘情。</p><p>趙露思身穿白色浴袍，被劇中的媽媽當街拉扯及破口大罵，又激動地用紙砸向她頭部，趙露思露出無辜及驚恐的表情，之後更淚如泉湧，整場</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:13:17.125144+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:40.305272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:40.305272+00:00","content_hash":"72c6f3a30987729b45fa11eea940991de8b3dc9dca12dadc36fce39fa7b39ec5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}